# Pao on Daisangen won by Ron from the LIABLE SEAT itself (engine.md §4.2, rules.md §1, §4.31).
# Round starts with honba=1 (300 on ron).
# Seat 2 feeds the 3rd dragon (7z) to Seat 1 (Pao against Seat 2),
# and then Seat 2 itself discards 4m -> Seat 1 rons 4m.
# Seat 2 pays 100% + honba = -32300; Seat 1 receives +32300.

